  "description": "Oil Continues to Plummet...But These Stocks Show Life 🌱",
  "body_html": "<p>For more than 2 years, I have been bearish on oil and continue to be bearish. Its usually the MAGA crowd that wants to push back the most…and by no means is this a political post; but that political bias is incredibly misleading (to be fair, many of the alternative energy investors were decimated during Biden’s time.). My forecast for oil still stands at ~$30 dollars a barrel. Oil moves incredibly slow, so do not expect it quickly, but we are inching our way towards that price. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G2oJ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fda4b1186-1363-4750-9d5e-11ba8db4af5a_1206x1014.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G2oJ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fda4b1186-1363-4750-9d5e-11ba8db4af5a_1206x1014.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G2oJ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fda4b1186-1363-4750-9d5e-11ba8db4af5a_1206x1014.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G2oJ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fda4b1186-1363-4750-9d5e-11ba8db4af5a_1206x1014.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G2oJ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fda4b1186-1363-4750-9d5e-11ba8db4af5a_1206x1014.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G2oJ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fda4b1186-1363-4750-9d5e-11ba8db4af5a_1206x1014.jpeg\" width=\"1206\" height=\"1014\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/da4b1186-1363-4750-9d5e-11ba8db4af5a_1206x1014.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1014,&quot;width&quot;:1206,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G2oJ!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fda4b1186-1363-4750-9d5e-11ba8db4af5a_1206x1014.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G2oJ!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fda4b1186-1363-4750-9d5e-11ba8db4af5a_1206x1014.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G2oJ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fda4b1186-1363-4750-9d5e-11ba8db4af5a_1206x1014.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G2oJ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fda4b1186-1363-4750-9d5e-11ba8db4af5a_1206x1014.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Political bias, or any emotional bias, destroys investors. </figcaption></figure></div><p>But you aren’t here to hear me toot my horn 🎺. <strong>What I want to bring to your attention is that alternative energy has been absolutely rocketing</strong>. Think about it, Bloom Energy was one of our better trades, and the #1 top performing stock from the <em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Screener</a>, </strong></em>rocketing over 230% since the signal! </p><p>And that is the not the only stock showing significant signs of life. This stock I recently purchased, and have every intention to accumulate in time. There are three primary reasons I have my eyes set on this stock:</p><ol><li><p>Forming local highs and breaking away from its long down trend. </p></li><li><p>The product they make, makes sense for nearly every electrical device you and I use, and for large scale corporation. The Total Addressable Market (TAM), is massive. </p></li><li><p>Jeff Neumann, an Unknown Market Wizard has discussed this sector as the next big wave. Jeff is famous for turning $2500 into $50,000,000. I respect his thoughts.</p></li></ol><h4>The stock is: </h4>",
